      "side": 0,
      "message": "If now pkvm relies on enable_ept_ad_bits to be 1, then probably we should also make sure hardware has this feature?\n\nE.g., in vmx_hardware_setup() line 7604, there is an if (!cpu_has_vmx_ept_ad_bits() || !enable_ept), which will still set enable_ept_ad_bits to 0.",
      "revId": "e9a21f3e32b4116fe62c9f3ea3830298fc94e4cf",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
